    # game/engine/char_template/functions_xp.rpy:96
    old "You have reached a new {i}experience level.{/i}\n\nYou can now open the 'characters' screen to distribute your {i}attribute and skill points{/i}. Your distribution of points will only apply if you hit 'confirm'."
    new "你已达到新的{i}经验等级{/i}\n\n现在可以打开‘角色’界面分配{i}属性和技能点数{/i}。只有点击‘确认’后点数分配才会生效。"

    # game/engine/char_template/functions_xp.rpy:105
    old "With this level-up, you have earned a perk point.\nPerks allow your parasite to develop certain unique abilities.\n\nPerk points are earned every 3 levels, starting from level 4.\nYou can find the new perks tab in the 'characters' screen."
    new "本次升级使你获得了1个特权点数。\n特权能让你的寄生体发展特定独特能力。\n\n特权点数每3级获得1次，从第4级开始计算。\n可在‘角色’界面找到新增的特权标签页。"

    # game/engine/char_template/functions_xp.rpy:120
    old "You have just earned some {i}experience points{/i}.\n\nIn Parasite Black, experience is earned mainly by completing quests and {i}unlocking lewd scenes{/i}. Fighting only awards small amounts of experience, and only {i}once for each unique enemy match-up{/i} you encounter.\n\nYou can track your progress to the next experience level in your 'equipment' screen."
    new "你刚刚获得了{i}经验值{/i}。\n\n在《寄生黑光》中，经验主要通过完成任务和{i}解锁色情场景{/i}获得。战斗仅提供少量经验，且仅对{i}每个首次遭遇的独特敌人组合{/i}奖励一次。\n\n可在‘装备’界面查看向下个经验等级的进度。"